### Form Submission Handler Needs Error Handling

The form submission handler lacks error handling and validation feedback.

<details>
<summary>Explanation</summary>
Proper error handling is crucial for user experience and debugging. The current implementation doesn't handle potential submission failures or provide user feedback.
</details>

```suggestion
  const handleSubmit = async (e: FormEvent<HTMLFormElement>) => {
    e.preventDefault();
    try {
      await onSubmit(formData);
      setFormData({
        name: '',
        email: '',
        message: ''
      });
    } catch (error) {
      console.error('Form submission failed:', error);
      // Add error state handling here
    }
  };
```

