### Ineffective useEffect Implementation

The useEffect hook has an empty dependency array but uses state, and the search length validation logic is incomplete.

<details>
<summary>Explanation</summary>
The current implementation only runs once on mount due to empty dependencies, making the search length validation ineffective. It should respond to search changes.
</details>

```suggestion
  useEffect(() => {
    if (search.length > 10) {
      setSearch(search.slice(0, 10));
    }
  }, [search]);
```

