### Contact List Performance Optimization

The contacts mapping implementation could benefit from performance optimizations.

<details>
<summary>Explanation</summary>
Using array index as key is an anti-pattern in React. Additionally, for large lists, consider implementing virtualization or pagination.
</details>

```suggestion
        {contacts.map((contact) => (
          <ContactCard
            key={`${contact.email}-${contact.name}`}
            name={contact.name}
            email={contact.email}
            message={contact.message}
          />
        ))}
```

